Z||000000||fieroburton||08-28-2001||12:05 AM||||who would buy  my car with all this new stuff in it --<BR>brakes (rotors , pads hoses)<BR>custom black interior<BR>fair paint <BR>new alternator<BR>battery<BR>but the car wont start ! <BR>it probly needs new spark plugs or somthing  but who would buy it for 1,400 if thats high give a offer  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>not realy selling the car just a quote<P>------------------<BR>1984 2M4 SE <BR>         <IMG SRC="http://publish.hometown.aol.com/fieroburton/myhomepage/07_07.jpg?mtbrand=AOL_US">     [URL=http://www.geocities.com/fieroburton/1.html]||||reg||5
Z||000001||Urchin||08-28-2001||12:10 AM||||What does it do when you turn the key.  Turn over but not sparking?  Not turning over at all...?  If you are thinking about selling, it would be to your advantage to fix the problem (if small).  You will be able to get more for it.  Give an description of what it is doing (or not doing) and chances are someone here will be able to help.  Just my thoughts...<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/side_cut_sig_4.jpg">  <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
